  - Id: 01
    Title: Assemble 118 components
    Criterion: Assemble 118 components
  - Id: 02
    Title: Complete 156 certified copper tasks and 50 vias
    Criterion: Complete 156 certified copper tasks and 50 vias
  - Id: 03
    Title: Capture initial diagnostic baseline
    Criterion: Capture initial diagnostic baseline
  - Id: 04
    Title: Prove root causes using evidence and isolation
    Criterion: Prove root causes using evidence and isolation
  - Id: 05
    Title: Repair F1-F3 and requalify cold/warm/PCIe
    Criterion: Repair F1-F3 and requalify cold/warm/PCIe
  - Id: 06
    Title: Disconnect/restore W157
    Criterion: Disconnect/restore W157; fresh safety qualification
  faults:
  - Id: F1
    Title: Leaky standby ceramic capacitor
    Mechanism: LEAKAGE_AND_CURRENT_LIMITING
    Evidence: 
    Repair: replace leaking capacitor
  - Id: F2
    Title: Intermittent U3 BGA contact
    Mechanism: TEMPERATURE_DEPENDENT_CONTACT
    Evidence: 
    Repair: controlled BGA rework or replacement
  - Id: F3
    Title: Intermittent PCIe reference-clock contact
    Mechanism: THERMALLY_INTERMITTENT_CLOCK
    Evidence: 
    Repair: clock solder contact restoration
